    {
      "text": "A forest plot of the difference in specificity (%) between TBST and T-SPOT.TB in BCG-vaccinated individuals: DST 5mm vs T-SPOT.TB −12.61 (Starshinova 2018a, adults −5.90 and children −18.70) and C-TST vs T-SPOT.TB −2.60 (Xu 2021, adults). The overall random-effects pooled difference is −9.67 (−31.12 to 11.79).",
